    narr:generatedFrom "44eef8e6195d368fddf26b3ce80125f26b4d5ef6" ;
    narr:narration """This hub tracks the [foundational positioning](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform) of a product defined as a [structured alternative](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat) to real-time chat. The strategy targets [remote teams of 10-50 people](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams), aiming to mitigate decision-loss. While the initial [pricing model](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars) was anchored at $12 per user, internal records show an early pivot to a $15 tier for larger groups. By August 2026, the narrative shifted from conceptual design to [demonstrable delivery](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryEvidence). The team now emphasizes concrete milestones, specifically the [shipment of an async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786700689257_1) and a [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786700689257_3), which are contextualized by [record-high velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786700689257_2). These developments mark a transition toward operational validation of the original async thesis.""" ;
